<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 9.62 to 5867.74.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 0.50 to 363.94.</p>
<p>Average price per share rose $0.05.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1,242 to 1,102.</p>
<p>Volume was 395,882,580 versus 395,811,840 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
